<title>USA: American Express says not in sale talks.</title>
<headline>American Express says not in sale talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Express Co said Friday it is not engaged in discussions with anyone regarding a sale of the firm or any part of the company.</p>
</text>
